  "details": "With the EAC announcement there is going to be an influx of issues with small avatars. There is currently a mod to change the near clipping field client side and without this I wont be able to play with my avatars since in at least 50% of the worlds dont work (it will clip out half your body arms make you not be able to use the VRC menus etc). I suggest adding an option to set your own near clipping field cause without this I and many others will be forced to switch to a competitor, or not be our true self again. (this is not only an issue for microscopic avatars but anything 1 meter and below)",
